      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SO SAY ME (1) was safely held in tougher company last start after drifting back at Sandown, but prior to that won by a neck at this track (26.09) beating Aston Arrow in a T3 RSTW on November 5. Comes through a solid form race last start. Has ability and looks hard to stop. JACQUI MOSS (2) has mixed form a little and missed the frame the last two but was a Grade 4/5 winner three back (28.16) at Bendigo over 500m. Well placed here and should do much better. MYSTERY NELL (7) looks close to another win after finishing second from Box 5 last time (19.66) at Healesville. Winning chance. MIA NEO (3) gets a chance to improve on an unplaced run at her latest outing at this circuit.",
